    p.font-mono.text-sm.leading-7.text-teal-600(class='lg:text-teal-400')
      span.text-gray-400(class='lg:text-gray-500') ~$&nbsp;
      | git log --author=vitor
    h1.mt-2.font-mono.text-3xl.font-bold.tracking-tight.text-gray-900(class='sm:text-4xl lg:text-white') Some of my contributions to the community
    p.mt-6.font-mono.text-lg.leading-8.text-gray-700(class='lg:text-gray-300')
      | I love open source — it's where I learned to code, where I go to tinker, and where I give back. Building in the open, reading other people's code, and shipping patches that anyone can use is what makes software fun for me. Here are some of the projects I've contributed to.
